ty applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":181169,"global_rank":400252},{"name":"dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","owner":"dustyjewett","html_url":"https://github.com/dustyjewett/igdb-api-proxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A docker image for proxying requests from a client to igdb.","topics":[],"score":181169,"global_rank":400253},{"name":"chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","owner":"chiarng","html_url":"https://github.com/chiarng/extint_jenkins_demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"App for demoing Jenkins Plugin for ServiceNow CI/CD","topics":[],"score":181169,"global_rank":400254},{"name":"erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","owner":"erinsteiner-NOAA","html_url":"https://github.com/erinsteiner-NOAA/fisheryconfidentiality","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Fledgling project to build tools to work with confidential fisheries data","topics":[],"score":181169,"global_rank":400255},{"name":"davidklett/katacoda-scenarios","owner":"davidklett","html_url":"https://github.com/davidklett/katacoda-scenarios","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Katacoda Scenarios","topics":[],"score":181169,"global_rank":400256},{"name":"DavidSuy/mc-exercise","owner":"DavidSuy","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidSuy/mc-exercise","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":1,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181167,"global_rank":400257},{"name":"psrc/rtp-2026-trends","owner":"psrc","html_url":"https://github.com/psrc/rtp-2026-trends","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A place for the proce